<title>NETHERLANDS: DRAKA 1996 NET PROFIT RISES 23 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>DRAKA 1996 NET PROFIT RISES 23 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     5.09 vs   4.15</p>
<p>    Net profit			    80.7  vs  65.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.53 vs   1.25</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		   1.26 vs   1.22</p>
<p>NOTE - Cable maker Draka Holding previously said it expected</p>
<p>a profit rise in 1996.</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   130.0  vs 120.1</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    23.6  vs  26.2</p>
<p>    Tax				     37.3  vs  33.3</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
